==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The Metal Hippoes are best handled using [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critters]], but fast attacking cats such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] and [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] are solid alternatives. [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] cats such as [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] or [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] can help deal with the Sir Seals and Pigges that spawn periodically. Heavy hitters like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] can also easily dispose of them.

==Trivia==
*A [[wikipedia:Peptide|peptide]] (included in the stage name) is a chain of [[wikipedia:Amino acid|amino acids]], which compose [[wikipedia:Protein|proteins]].
*Prior to [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]], this stage was known as "Peptide snowfield".

